# Constraints

## Primary Key

```
id
```

---

## Foreign Key

```
intake_id
    ↓
intake.intake_id
```

Every roster record originates from a valid intake record.

---

## Unique Constraint

```
intake_id
```

An applicant can only become an active roster member once, preventing duplicate talent profiles.

