# Common Use Cases

- Maintain an agency's active talent roster.
- Manage contracts and representation status.
- Track career progression from new face to established talent.
- Store AI-generated talent intelligence for casting and brand matching.
- Manage portfolio assets and digital representation rights.
- Support agent assignment and ongoing talent development.